WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:03.682
By the end of this module you should be able to
identify long and wide

00:00:03.708 --> 00:00:10.896
structures pivot and unpivot data in PostgreSQL and
explain the grain of each result You

00:00:10.923 --> 00:00:15.475
should also be able to detect when a reshape changes
more than structure because aggregation

00:00:15.502 --> 00:00:20.817
or a join has altered the facts Finally you should
be able to choose a

00:00:20.843 --> 00:00:25.146
shape based on what happens next visualization
reporting or modeling
